  "format": "yaml-oracle/1",
  "notes": "Scalar resolution as ASH's YAML loader reads it (YAML 1.1 words, numbers, nulls, timestamps, explicit tags). value is the projection of the loader's result; see yaml-oracle.test.js for the projection rules."
